	(text "J5 pinout read from the original drawing (ARCHITECTURE.md 8): signals on odd pins, ground on even pins. Confirm with a meter (Q18).\nThe 100 k pull-downs keep the DMD lines low while the RP2354B boots.\nJ18 is the default GI dimmer link of ARCHITECTURE.md 10.2: +5 V, GND, GI_PWM, GI_SPARE."
